//     \`local.y\` ∈ [-0.5, 0.5] after the CSS-Y-down → world-Y-up flip.
//   - \`iAtlasOrigin\` / \`iAtlasSize\` are pre-flipped by \`WordAtlas.ts\`
//     so \`cornerLocal.y = 1\` (top of word in world space) hits the
//     visual top of the tile in the canvas.
